# Security headers (Netlify/Cloudflare-style _headers). Mirror these at your
# host of choice (Vercel: vercel.json "headers"; etc.).
#
# - COOP/COEP: cross-origin isolation, required for WebContainers
#   (window.crossOriginIsolated must be true). `credentialless` is used so no
#   subresource needs CORP headers.
# - The main Content-Security-Policy is emitted per-page by Astro as a
#   <meta http-equiv> (it auto-hashes inline island scripts/styles). The header
#   below only carries `frame-ancestors`, which <meta> cannot express.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
